  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He agrees that traces at the immortal zombie graveyard might let them estimate some of Old Ancestor Xue Hu’s methods. The battlefield still leaves him grim. He addresses Blazing Heaven Demoness and Northern Plains Zombie Alliance, asking forgiveness, and states that the hidden fighter is a ten extreme immortal zombie on a secret headquarters mission, now a top priority rescue. When Corpse Detonation King urges a direct approach, he supports Blazing Heaven Demoness instead: Old Ancestor Xue Hu holds a hostage, so an open suppression would be restricted. He then puts a hand on Corpse Detonation King’s shoulder and asks her, with a sharp gaze, what they should do.",
      "chapters": [
        929
      ],
